{"id":"22bac6157fe16489","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pbmaxelimcorrect.md","title":"Exact elimination and reconstruction of all maximizers","display":"thm-pbmaxelimcorrect — Exact elimination and reconstruction of all maximizers","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pbmaxelimcorrect","aliases":["27-thm-pbmaxelimcorrect"],"display":"thm-pbmaxelimcorrect — Exact elimination and reconstruction of all maximizers","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbmaxelim]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.4.2","source_statement":"Correctness of the elimination and backtracking procedure","source_printed_pages":"587–588","source_pdf_pages":"611–612","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pbmaxelimcorrect"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pbmaxelimcorrect</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pbmaxelimcorrect — Exact elimination and reconstruction of all maximizers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"47dbc06b9bee7a7b\" href=\"?note=47dbc06b9bee7a7b\" title=\"27-df-pbmaxelim\">27-df-pbmaxelim</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.4.2"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Correctness of the elimination and backtracking procedure"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"587–588"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"611–612"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_b:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B^n\">\\(\\iota_b:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbb B\">\\(b\\in\\mathbb B\\)</span>）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_f,\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f),\\mathrm{MaxSel}(f)\">\\(\\Delta_f,\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f),\\mathrm{MaxSel}(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"47dbc06b9bee7a7b\" href=\"?note=47dbc06b9bee7a7b\" title=\"27-df-pbmaxelim\">27-df-pbmaxelim</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBArgmax}\">\\(\\mathrm{PBArgmax}\\)</span> 取其上游 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a668791f62b82e2a\" href=\"?note=a668791f62b82e2a\" title=\"27-df-pbopt\">27-df-pbopt</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\quad\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f)(y)=\\max_{b\\in\\mathbb B}f(\\iota_b(y))=f(\\iota_{\\mathrm{MaxSel}(f)(y)}(y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\quad\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f)(y)=\\max_{b\\in\\mathbb B}f(\\iota_b(y))=f(\\iota_{\\mathrm{MaxSel}(f)(y)}(y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a)=\\max_{y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}}\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f)(y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a)=\\max_{y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}}\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f)(y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(f)=\\{\\iota_b(y):y\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f)),\\ b\\in\\mathbb B,\\ b\\Delta_f(y)=\\max\\{0,\\Delta_f(y)\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(f)=\\{\\iota_b(y):y\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f)),\\ b\\in\\mathbb B,\\ b\\Delta_f(y)=\\max\\{0,\\Delta_f(y)\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已核对印587–588/PDF611–612的消元构造，并给出全部优化点的局部证明。对每个 y，两个值是 f(ι₀(y)) 与 f(ι₀(y))+Δ_f(y)，故最大值和选择器公式成立。每个 a 唯一写成 ι_b(y)，所以全局最大值可先对 b 再对 y 最大化。达到全局最大值的必要充分条件恰为 y 达到消元后最大值，且 b 达到该 y 的局部两值最大值；Δ=0 时两个 b 都保留。反复降元最终到 n=0，数学上终止。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbmaxelim","status":"resolved","id":"47dbc06b9bee7a7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbmaxelim]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbmaxelim","status":"resolved","id":"47dbc06b9bee7a7b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$n\\ge1$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$\\iota_b:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B^n$（$b\\in\\mathbb B$）、$\\Delta_f,\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f),\\mathrm{MaxSel}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-pbmaxelim]]，$\\mathrm{PBArgmax}$ 取其上游 [[27-df-pbopt]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbopt","status":"resolved","id":"a668791f62b82e2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$n\\ge1$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$\\iota_b:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B^n$（$b\\in\\mathbb B$）、$\\Delta_f,\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f),\\mathrm{MaxSel}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-pbmaxelim]]，$\\mathrm{PBArgmax}$ 取其上游 [[27-df-pbopt]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_b:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_f,\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f),\\mathrm{MaxSel}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBArgmax}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\quad\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f)(y)=\\max_{b\\in\\mathbb B}f(\\iota_b(y))=f(\\iota_{\\mathrm{MaxSel}(f)(y)}(y)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(a)=\\max_{y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}}\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f)(y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(f)=\\{\\iota_b(y):y\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f)),\\ b\\in\\mathbb B,\\ b\\Delta_f(y)=\\max\\{0,\\Delta_f(y)\\}\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1954,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-493","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbmaxelimcorrect|thm-pbmaxelimcorrect — Exact elimination and reconstruction of all maximizers]]"}],"outgoing":["47dbc06b9bee7a7b","a668791f62b82e2a"]}